      "id": "sce-pitch-insight-advantage-money-c1",
      "heading": "Insight and Uniqueness / Unfair Advantage",
      "explanation_md": "Two slides ask what sets you apart, each as a sharp question.\n\n**Insight: What do you understand that others just don't know?**\n\n**Uniqueness / Unfair Advantage: Why it would be hard for others to duplicate what you are going to do?**\n\nKeep the two apart: the **insight** slide is about what you **understand** that others don't know; the **unfair advantage** slide is about why others would find it **hard to duplicate** what you do.",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [
        {
